## Q6 (gui-stack-v1-issues) — arithmetic embedded in string interpolation.
## Regression pin: a `#{w / 2}` segment once printed the un-divided operand
## (tally's PPM header printed "112" instead of "56 84"). Lock division,
## the multi-segment case, and a mix of operators inside one interpolation.

def main
  let w = 112
  let h = 168
  puts "#{w / 2} #{h / 2}"
  puts "P3\n#{w / 2} #{h / 2}\n255"
  let a = 7
  let b = 3
  puts "#{a + b} #{a - b} #{a * b} #{a % b}"
end
